{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup", "label": "Handoff 2026-11-14: graph refreshed, PROJECT_STATE cut, SQL map, closing protocol mandatory", "file_type": "document", "rationale": "Status COMPLETE for session scope; pushed to origin/main (eba7643) except closing-step files. Chain: tooling, not MVP execution; MVP entry point still handoff_20261107 section 0. Results: repo graph 6,221 nodes / 637 communities, 73 SECURITY DEFINER claims verified (5 corrected); PROJECT_STATE 838 lines/214 KB -> 44 lines/~5 KB; archive byte-identical; docs/db/SCHEMA_SUMMARY.md from scripts/db/schema-summary.mjs (165/165 migrations, 35 tables, regex map); local pre-commit hook; closing protocol mandatory; cold-agent test 6/8, 6/8, 7/8 vs bar 7. Not pushed: this handoff, PROJECT_STATE pointer, graph refresh.", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_decide_headroom", "label": "Decide 1: Headroom exemption", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "headroom plugin compresses tool output; cold agents read PROJECT_STATE.md and CLAUDE.md garbled and ignored the order to headroom_retrieve (0 of 6 markers retrieved on last run). 'Waiting on Ivan' failed 3 of 3 cold tests. Recommend: exempt those two files in the plugin's config. Cost: plugin config change, about 10 minutes.", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_decide_commit_handoff", "label": "Decide 2: Commit untracked MVP rewalk handoff", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "handoff_20261107-mvp-rewalk-q51-role-rights.md is untracked; new PROJECT_STATE points at it so the pointer dangles for clones. Recommend commit. Not Claude's to commit unasked.", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_decide_hooks_local", "label": "Decide 3: Hooks local only", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Local .git/hooks/pre-commit (SQL summary sync, handoff closing check) is not in the repo. Recommend keep local for now; move to tracked hooks dir (core.hooksPath) only if every clone should enforce it.", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_decide_hard_rule_1", "label": "Decide 4: CLAUDE.md Hard Rule 1 wording", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Still says OTP/password+MFA (carried from 2026-11-07 list).", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_finding_graphify_update", "label": "Finding: graphify update destroys curated graph", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "graphify update and the graphify post-commit hook rebuild an AST-only graph (10,595 nodes, 3,849 communities, 526 KB report), destroying the curated graph. Do not install them.", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_finding_stale_manifest_rows", "label": "Finding: 19 deleted manifest files were stale rows", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The 19 deleted files in the manifest were stale rows, not graph nodes.", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_finding_extraction_invents", "label": "Finding: compressed extraction invents content", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Agent extraction under compression invents content. Verify every extracted claim against the source file by script.", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_finding_cancellation_reason_conflict", "label": "Finding: events.cancellation_reason has no natural place", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Edits are draft-only (events_draft_only_detail_edits) and cancelling is definer-only, so an events.cancellation_reason field has no natural place yet. Read, unverified.", "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup", "target": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_decide_headroom", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup", "target": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_decide_commit_handoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/plans/handoff_20261114-graph-state-cleanup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup", "target": "docs_plans_handoff_20261114_graph_state_cleanup_decide_hooks_local", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source